        "id": 1002022
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T22:51:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it\u0027s supposed to be Rd+Ra.  Could you please file a bug with CC ADC readings in this state?",
      "parentUuid": "6fb3f40b_c73bb7b9",
      "revId": "b4289bd3ad3edf10e93d74b1256fb1b849298e3b",
